For the singlet, $\rho_A
=\operatorname{Tr}_B\ket{S}\bra{S}
=\frac12\ket{u}\bra{u}
+\frac12\ket{d}\bra{d}
=\frac12 I.$ Its eigenvalues are $\operatorname{spec}(\rho_A)
=\left\{\frac12,\frac12\right\}.$ Alice’s local state is maximally mixed even though the state of the pair is pure.

